      "level": 0,
      "text": "mAPval 值基于 COCO val2017 数据集上的单模型、单尺度评估。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "通过 yolo val segment data=coco.yaml device=0 nms=False 复现"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "速度是在使用 Amazon EC2 P4d 实例处理 COCO val 图像时的平均值。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "通过 yolo val segment data=coco.yaml batch=1 device=0|cpu nms=False 复现"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "Params 和 FLOPs 数值适用于在进行卷积与批归一化折叠以及移除未使用的检测分支之后的融合模型。预训练检查点保留完整的训练架构，可能会显示更高的数值。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这些检查点可分割 COCO 的 80 个类别。若要在无需重新训练的情况下分割该列表之外的类别，请参阅 YOLOE，它可以将类别作为文本提示、视觉示例或内置词汇表输入。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请参阅unreleased YOLO27 preview以获取初步的COCO边界框和掩码结果。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "训练#"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "在 COCO8-seg 数据集上训练 YOLO26n-seg，图像大小为 640，训练 100 个轮次。可用参数的完整列表请参阅配置页面。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "示例"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "from ultralytics import YOLO\n\n# Load a model\nmodel = YOLO(\"yolo26n-seg.yaml\") # build a new model from YAML\nmodel = YOLO(\"yolo26n-seg.pt\") # load a pretrained model (recommended for training)\nmodel = YOLO(\"yolo26n-seg.yaml\").load(\"yolo26n-seg.pt\") # build from YAML and transfer weights\n\n# Train the model\nresults = model.train(data=\"coco8-seg.yaml\", epochs=100, imgsz=640)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "在训练页面查看完整的 train 模式详情。分割模型也可以使用 Ultralytics Platform 云训练进行训练。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "数据集格式#"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "YOLO 分割数据集格式的详细信息可在数据集指南中找到。要将现有的 COCO JSON 数据集转换为 YOLO 格式，请使用内置的 convert_coco 函数及 use_segments=True，如COCO 转 YOLO 指南中所述。你还可以使用多边形工具和由 SAM 驱动的智能标注功能，通过Ultralytics 平台标注来创建分割掩码。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "验证#"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "在 COCO8-seg 数据集上验证训练好的 YOLO26n-seg 模型的准确率。无需提供参数，因为 model 会将其训练用的 data 和参数保留为模型属性。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "示例"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "from ultralytics import YOLO\n\n# Load a model\nmodel = YOLO(\"yolo26n-seg.pt\") # load an official model\nmodel = YOLO(\"path/to/best.pt\") # load a custom model\n\n# Validate the model\nmetrics = model.val() # no arguments needed, dataset and settings remembered\nmetrics.box.map # map50-95(B)\nmetrics.box.map50 # map50(B)\nmetrics.box.map75 # map75(B)\nmetrics.box.maps # a list containing mAP50-95(B) for each category\nmetrics.box.image_metrics # per-image metrics dictionary for det with precision, recall, F1, TP, FP, and FN\nmetrics.seg.map # map50-95(M)\nmetrics.seg.map50 # map50(M)\nmetrics.seg.map75 # map75(M)\nmetrics.seg.maps # a list containing mAP50-95(M) for each category\nmetrics.seg.image_metrics # per-image metrics dictionary for seg with precision, recall, F1, TP, FP, and FN"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Predict#"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "使用训练好的 YOLO26n-seg 模型对图像运行预测。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "示例"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "from ultralytics import YOLO\n\n# Load a model\nmodel = YOLO(\"yolo26n-seg.pt\") # load an official model\nmodel = YOLO(\"path/to/best.pt\") # load a custom model\n\n# Predict with the model\nresults = model(\"https://ultralytics.com/images/bus.jpg\") # predict on an image\n\n# Access the results\nfor result in results:\nxy = result.masks.xy # mask polygons in pixel coordinates\nxyn = result.masks.xyn # normalized mask polygons\nmasks = result.masks.data # binary masks, shape (N,H,W), dtype torch.uint8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请在预测页面查看完整的 predict 模式详情。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "结果输出#"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "YOLO 实例分割会为每张图像返回一个 Results 对象。每个结果都存储对象级预测，其中\n每个检测到的实例都有自己的二值掩码、类别、置信度和边界框。"
    },
